<p>You call upon the earth to create a blinding, corrosive cloud in an area of radius 4 for 5 turns.</p><p>Each turn, this cloud deals <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">71, 96, 115, 131, 145</acronym> acid damage to each foe with a 25% chance to blind and a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">23%, 28%, 31%, 34%, 36%</acronym> chance of burning away one magical sustain or beneficial magical effect.</p><p>The damage increases with your Mindpower.</p>